Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value LINK_STATUS (\S+)
Value LINE_PROTOCOL_STATUS (\S+)
Value DESCRIPTION ([^\n]+)
Value MTU (\d+)
Value IP_ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+\/\d+)
Value HARDWARE_ADDRESS ([0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4})
Value PORT_BW (\d+G)
Value DUPLEX (\S+)
Value LAST_UP_TIME (\S+ \S+ \S+)
Value RX_POWER (-?\d+\.\d+dBm)
Value TX_POWER (-?\d+\.\d+dBm)
Value WARNING_RANGE_RX ([^\n]+)
Value CRC_ERRORS (\d+)
Value OTHER_ERRORS (\d+)

Start
  ^${INTERFACE} current state :${LINK_STATUS} .*
  ^Line protocol current state : ${LINE_PROTOCOL_STATUS}
  ^Description: ${DESCRIPTION}
  ^Route Port,The Maximum Transmit Unit is ${MTU}
  ^Internet Address is ${IP_ADDRESS}
  ^IP Sending Frames' Format is \S+, Hardware address is ${HARDWARE_ADDRESS}
  ^Port BW: ${PORT_BW}
  ^\S+ duplex mode
  ^Last \S+ up time   : ${LAST_UP_TIME}
  ^Last 300 seconds input rate: \d+ bits/sec, \d+ packets/sec
  ^Last 300 seconds output rate: \d+ bits/sec, \d+ packets/sec
  ^Rx Power: ${RX_POWER}
  ^Warning range: ${WARNING_RANGE_RX}
  ^Tx Power: ${TX_POWER}
  ^Input:
  ^  Unicast: \d+ packets, Multicast: \d+ packets
  ^  Broadcast: \d+ packets
  ^  CRC: ${CRC_ERRORS} packets
  ^  Other: ${OTHER_ERRORS} packets
  ^Output:
  ^  Unicast: \d+ packets, Multicast: \d+ packets
  ^  Broadcast: \d+ packets
  ^  Total output error: \d+ packets

